                                                "example_id": "609551d8-8c38-4e77-86ad-84799f0ee4f1",
                                                "sense_id": "b797322a-01ba-34d4-8aa6-15fbfc1fe214",
                                                "text": "The Dutch oil can is a wicked looking object about a yard long and each driver has his own place for keeping it, varying from behind the brake pump to the top of the outer firebox inside the cab."
